   "updated": 1760000000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "iommu.passthrough=0|1、iommu.strict=0|1\nx86：intel_iommu=on、iommu=pt\n默认：arm64 strict，x86 lazy（CONFIG_IOMMU_DEFAULT_*）\n\n/sys/kernel/iommu_groups/<N>/\n  devices：组里有哪些设备\n  type：DMA / DMA-FQ / identity / auto（可写）\n  reserved_regions：保留区",
   "originalText": "iommu.passthrough=0|1、iommu.strict=0|1\nx86：intel_iommu=on、iommu=pt\n默认：arm64 strict，x86 lazy（CONFIG_IOMMU_DEFAULT_*）\n\n/sys/kernel/iommu_groups/<N>/\n  devices：组里有哪些设备\n  type：DMA / DMA-FQ / identity / auto（可写）\n  reserved_regions：保留区",
   "fontSize": 14,
